OL,3,GNEWSASheep return to roof of cinema
OL,4,Acomplex to keep lawn in trim
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cinema complex in Lancashire has come
OL,7,Fup with a lawn-mowing solution with a
OL,8,Fdifference - by deploying sheep on to
OL,9,Fits grass-topped roof to help keep it
OL,10,Fin trim.
OL,12,FThe six Dutch spotted sheep belong to
OL,13,FMyerscough College but have been moved
OL,14,Fa mile or two down the road to the
OL,15,FFlower Bowl in Preston, which houses a
OL,16,Fbowling alley, restaurants and sports
OL,17,Ffacilities.
OL,19,FThe centre had sheep in previous years
OL,20,Fbut they were moved out for safety
OL,21,Freasons during the coronavirus
OL,22,Fpandemic.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,403,400,260,160,0,100
